# Every .md file in this repo is at least partly owned by scripts/build.py
# (TOC / breadcrumbs / tags / cross-references / progress / stats markers).
# Prettier reformatting them — even innocuously — risks producing a diff
# that disagrees with what build.py regenerates, which is exactly what CI
# checks for. Markdown formatting in this repo is enforced by the Python
# scripts + markdownlint, not Prettier. See .vscode/README.md.
*.md

.git/
__pycache__/
